[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4930457153","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121104#issuecomment-4930457153","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121104","id":4930457153,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJeDOQQ","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-09T23:24:53Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T23:24:53Z","body":"We need more people to test this and give feedback, so far frame pacing has been stable for developers including many developers who've launched Godot titles suggesting this problem only happens when another component is in play.\n\nSo far been unable to replicate on our end.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4930457153/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4930781518","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121104#issuecomment-4930781518","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121104","id":4930781518,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJeXBTg","user":{"login":"williamdev06","id":135645566,"node_id":"U_kgDOCBXJfg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135645566?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06","html_url":"https://github.com/williamdev06","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-10T00:25:11Z","updated_at":"2026-07-10T00:25:11Z","body":"Agreed and interesting insight. Out of interest what was seen on your end? Was it the same fluctuating Delta or was is stable 90fps or whatever refresh rate was used in testing. Could also be something specific to my headset, maybe something broken or software issue. I will need to do more testing on my headset, perhaps factory reset it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4930781518/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5939168040","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121104#issuecomment-5939168040","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121104","id":5939168040,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYgCDKA","user":{"login":"JohanAR","id":4918549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTg1NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4918549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohanAR","html_url":"https://github.com/JohanAR","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohanAR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohanAR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohanAR/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohanAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohanAR/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohanAR/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohanAR/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohanAR/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohanAR/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-01T19:41:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T19:47:28Z","body":"edit: My setup is much closer to 120089 so it's more likely my issue is related to that. Will continue testing, but I suppose I'll leave my comment here just in case.\n\nThis might be the same issue that I have been trying to debug today. I'm getting intermittent missed frames, SteamVR reports them as \"late start\" and they do not show up in Godot's profiler. Happens in empty VR scene, both in Godot 4.7.1 (official release) and my fork of 4.8 which I'm using for development.\n\nDuring one minute test run I got one frame spike at 23 seconds, one at 26, and then there were nothing until 55 seconds, and also a double spike at 57 seconds with only 3 frames in between (just as an example of how irregularly it happens).\n\nI have also noticed that sometimes my whole desktop/mouse stutters at the same time it happens, if I have the Godot VR app running in the background.\n\nFedora 44\nRyzen 7 7700X 32GB DDR5\nRTX 3090 nvidia driver 610.57.04 (I'm going to try upgrading to 615 which I think is available)\nHTC Vive\nSteamVR 2.17.10 and also SteamVR [beta] 2.18.2","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5939168040/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]